        {
          "text": " Abu keira eporoto loebuni kotoma akuj kobala ebe, “Kiwadik ebe: Isirereŋitoi lukatwak, luetwakete kotoma Ejakait amear lolo.” Eebo, ebala Emoyo ebe, “Tetere ibworarete kotoma aitaaritoikec; naarai euparos akeceswamisio kakes!”",
