        },
        {
          "text": " Kosodi kolom emalaika ece kotem, kojai apolou kama ejai akim, kiworoi keporoto loepol mama ejai ŋol loejai ecilikiki loekwana, ebe, “Kijuka ecilikikikon loekwana, kode aibuŋeta nuka emusabibu loka akwap, naarai akoko noi imusabibunuke.” ",
